{
"recipe_id":"9 Classic Moussaka",
"source_text":"Moussaka - Recipe 2\n\n用料\n分三部分：\n茄子部分：茄子、盐、橄榄油\n肉酱部分：橄榄油、小洋葱、蒜、牛肉/羊肉馅、红酒、西红柿、番茄糊、牛肉汁、肉桂、paprika、肉豆蔻、糖、黑胡椒、盐\n奶油酱部分：黄油、面粉、牛奶、盐、肉豆蔻、帕玛森芝士、蛋黄 \n\n做法整理\n茄子切片，双面撒盐静置 30 分钟，再用厨房纸吸水，随后下锅热油煎 2–3 分钟。\n另起锅热油，炒洋葱和蒜至透明，加入肉和调料，再加入红酒，煮约 20–30 分钟。\n平底锅中融化黄油，慢慢加入面粉并搅成糊，再缓缓加入牛奶，之后加入奶酪；放凉 15–20 分钟后慢慢加入鸡蛋。\n烤箱预热 375°F，烤盘抹油，按“一半茄子—肉酱—剩下的茄子—奶油酱”的顺序铺层，表面再撒帕玛森芝士，烤 40–50 分钟，出炉前静置 10 分钟。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "茄子切片", "text_en": "Slice the eggplant.", "start_char": 141, "end_char": 145, "node_indices": [1, 2], "edge_indices": [1], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "双面撒盐", "text_en": "Sprinkle salt on both sides of the eggplant.", "start_char": 146, "end_char": 150, "node_indices": [2, 3], "edge_indices": [2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 2, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "静置 30 分钟", "text_en": "Let the eggplant stand for 30 minutes.", "start_char": 150, "end_char": 159, "node_indices": [2, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 3, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "再用厨房纸吸水", "text_en": "Then absorb the moisture with kitchen paper.", "start_char": 160, "end_char": 167, "node_indices": [4, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 4, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "随后下锅热油", "text_en": "Then heat oil in a pan.", "start_char": 168, "end_char": 174, "node_indices": [6, 7, 8], "edge_indices": [5, 6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 5, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "下锅热油煎 2–3 分钟", "text_en": "Fry the eggplant in the pan with hot oil for 2–3 minutes.", "start_char": 170, "end_char": 182, "node_indices": [5, 8, 9], "edge_indices": [7, 8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 7, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 7, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 8, "role": "environment"}, {"node_inde